WEBVTT

00:10:59.042 --> 00:11:00.684
allamericans.org,

00:11:00.708 --> 00:11:02.434
civicalliance.com

00:11:02.458 --> 00:11:05.643
and the Fight Back table at demos.org.

00:11:05.667 --> 00:11:07.476
All these groups are working on this.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:10.309
Now, on the right,
if that's your cup of tea,

00:11:10.333 --> 00:11:13.018
you could also check out
The Heritage Foundation

00:11:13.042 --> 00:11:15.101
or the Government
Accountability Institute.

00:11:15.125 --> 00:11:17.143
They are focused on voter fraud.

00:11:17.167 --> 00:11:20.101
But you've got to get informed,
no matter what side you're on.

00:11:20.125 --> 00:11:21.393
Also, number two,

00:11:21.417 --> 00:11:23.601
you've got to get loud.

00:11:23.625 --> 00:11:24.893
You've got to get loud.

00:11:24.917 --> 00:11:29.518
Situation like this, these days,
everybody is a media channel.

00:11:29.542 --> 00:11:31.309
You are the media.